IMPORTANT — DATA NOTICE
========================

This software is designed to work with the MIMIC-CXR and MIMIC-IV datasets,
which are credentialed-access clinical databases hosted by PhysioNet:

  MIMIC-CXR-JPG:  https://physionet.org/content/mimic-cxr-jpg/2.0.0/
  MIMIC-IV:       https://physionet.org/content/mimiciv/

The MIMIC datasets are NOT included in this repository and are NOT covered
by this MIT License. Access requires:
  1. Completion of the CITI Human Subjects Research training course
  2. Signing the PhysioNet Data Use Agreement (DUA)
  3. Individual PhysioNet credentialing approval

Do NOT share, redistribute, or publish MIMIC data in any form.
